      "writtenOn": "2023-03-24T19:36:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "These are the right types - they will increment the ref count in the Dawn object on creation and decrement it on destruction. So these are like sk_ref_sp(T* obj) which increments the ref count and not like SkRefCnt(T* obj) which doesn\u0027t increment the ref count. Aside: wgpu::Texture::Acquire() is what you want if you don\u0027t want to increment the ref count.\n\nhttps://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:out/mac-Debug/gen/third_party/dawn/include/dawn/webgpu_cpp.h;l\u003d693?q\u003dObjectBase::ObjectBase\u0026ss\u003dchromium%2Fchromium%2Fsrc",
      "parentUuid": "681b0e44_bf4f0e20",
